The original GameIndex.yaml is retained unmodified inside GameIndex.yaml.xz
(lossless XZ compression). Its decompressed SHA-256 is
6589964b54348a4af845bb33311375fa1596c55864be750e9fbdc69c8d7dcdcd.
The generated derivative
serial/title table selects standard serial keys and their name fields only;
name-en and emulator settings are not exported. Generated by PortareLauncher
on 2026-10-17; 12,830 entries, 599,092 bytes in UTF-8, sorted by serial.
Normal builds use that checked-in table; make regen-disc-title-tables
regenerates it offline and verifies the original source checksum.
PCSX2's GPL-3.0-or-later terms are retained in COPYING.GPLv3 for this data.
The launcher code remains under its existing license.

